# oracle: w319dpd_ext_tstat_ramp — w77dpd_noise_dpdext_tstat_spce with a temperature ramp (pair_style dpd/ext/tstat 300 150): sigma and sigmaT follow the ramped T
# oracle-inputs: w77dpd_cg_spce.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=0
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.0e-13, atoms 7.3e-15.
units            real
boundary     p p p
atom_style   atomic
dimension    3
newton       on
comm_modify  vel yes
read_data    w77dpd_cg_spce.data
pair_style       dpd/ext/tstat 300.0 150.0 10.0 385262
pair_coeff   1 1 20.0 10.0 0.5 0.5 10.0
timestep    1.0
run_style   verlet
velocity all create 300.0 68768932
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo       5
fix 1 all    nve
run          20
